OL,5,G1535 Emmerdale
OL,6,     FJimmy sells his haulage business.
OL,7,     FNicola is delighted. Jimmy agrees
OL,8,     Fto a vow renewal.
OL,9,G1605 Coronation Street
OL,10,     FGlenda's stinging criticism gives
OL,11,     FTodd a taste for revenge, Tim
OL,12,     Fattempts to soothe a jumpy Lucy,
OL,13,     Fand Nina holds out little hope
OL,14,     Fafter an underwhelming job
OL,15,     Finterview.
