OL,5,G0000 Mr Selfridge
OL,6,     FHarry Selfridge is a businessman
OL,7,     Fwho comes to the United Kingdom
OL,8,     Fand uses his personality and
OL,9,     Fskills to climb the ladder of
OL,10,     Fcommercial success.
OL,11,G0100 Victoria
OL,12,     FVictoria ascends the British
OL,13,     Fthrone at the tender age of 18 and
OL,14,     Flater falls in love with Prince
OL,15,     FAlbert and gets married to him.
OL,16,G0200 Spreadsheet
OL,17,     FMeet Lauren. Her life's a bit of a
OL,18,     Fmess. She's a busy lawyer, freshly
